==============================================================================
S1b. control: the SAME race but with interrupt() instead of a node error
==============================================================================
_suppress_interrupt returns True for a top-level GraphInterrupt, which makes
ExitStack hand (None,None,None) to BackgroundExecutor.__exit__.

