==============================================================================
S7. _error_handler_write_futs -- the concurrent.futures.wait path
==============================================================================
A node with error_handler=... makes commit() append ERROR_SOURCE_NODE writes
and collect their futures; schedule_error_handler then WAITS on them
(concurrent.futures.wait, which never raises) before running the handler.

